{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47023","headline":"赠持法华经僧 · 齐己","name":"赠持法华经僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆人有口，不说是，即说非。\n吾师有口何所爲，莲经七轴六万九千字。\n日日夜夜终复始。\n乍吟乍讽何悠扬，风篁古松含秋霜。\n但恐天龙夜叉乾闼衆，㽬塞虚空耳皆耸。\n我闻念经功德缘，舌根可算金刚坚。\n他时劫火洞燃後，神光璨璨如红莲。\n受持身心苟精洁，尚能使烦恼大海水枯竭。\n魔王轮幢自摧折，何况更如理行如理说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}